{"unit_id":"MingHuanYue__dsh-iter-memory#card-zh","repo":"MingHuanYue/dsh-iter-memory","commit":"d998f12b0fcbeec0e605cdb72eee19d040c8857d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-iter-memory 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话状态与主动开口插件。它在宿主中注册状态、记心情、调参数和立即开口等工具，并提供设置页查看潮位曲线、调整节拍与语气。插件按会话保存状态，用户回复会抬高状态，长时间未回应会降低状态；潮汐记忆的注入也可带来有限提升。主动消息根据活跃时段、冷却、每日次数和状态概率触发。适合希望 DSH 保留状态变化并偶尔主动交谈的用户；不需要 API 密钥，数据写入本地目录，投递依赖宿主 schedule 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:463-593","lib/index.js:649-750","lib/core.js:129-203"]}
{"unit_id":"MingHuanYue__dsh-iter-memory#card-en","repo":"MingHuanYue/dsh-iter-memory","commit":"d998f12b0fcbeec0e605cdb72eee19d040c8857d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-iter-memory tracks mood per DSH session and can speak proactively. Its tools and settings panel let users record mood, set timing, and view a curve. Replies and ignored messages affect speaking probability. No API key is needed; data is local and the host scheduler delivers messages.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:463-593","lib/index.js:649-750","lib/core.js:129-203"]}
